<div class="post-shell">
  <a class="back-link" href="<%= url_for('/') %>"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span> 回到閱讀練習</a>
  <header class="post-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE JAPANESE, EVERY DAY</p>
    <div class="lesson-meta"><span class="level-label"><%= page.level || '日文閱讀' %></span><time datetime="<%= date_xml(page.date) %>"><%= date(page.date, 'YYYY.MM.DD') %></time></div>
    <h1><%= page.reading_title || page.title %></h1>
    <p><%= page.description || theme.tagline %></p>
  </header>
  <div class="post-grid">
    <aside class="reading-sidebar" aria-label="閱讀輔助">
      <div class="sidebar-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">這一篇，慢慢讀</p>
        <nav aria-label="文章目錄"><%- toc(page.content, {list_number: false, max_depth: 2}) %></nav>
        <div class="sidebar-tip"><span aria-hidden="true">あ</span><p>先試著讀日文，<br>再打開翻譯確認。<br>每讀一次，都會更熟悉。</p></div>
      </div>
    </aside>
    <div class="reading-main">
      <% if (page.learning) { %>
      <div class="reading-tools" aria-label="閱讀設定" hidden>
        <span class="tools-label">閱讀設定</span>
        <button type="button" data-toggle="furigana" aria-pressed="true">漢字標音 <span data-state>開</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-toggle="translation" aria-pressed="true">中文翻譯 <span data-state>開</span></button>
        <label class="font-control">字級 <select id="reading-font"><option value="normal">標準</option><option value="large">加大</option><option value="larger">更大</option></select></label>
      </div>
      <% } %>
      <article class="article-content" data-learning="<%= !!page.learning %>"><%- page.content %></article>
      <div class="reading-end"><span aria-hidden="true">✦</span><p>今天也多讀懂了一點。</p><a href="#main">回到文章開頭 ↑</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
